        "S1-https-and-secure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "text": "Attempt login-CSRF with another browser's valid transaction, wrong cookie/state, expired/reused code, nonce/audience/signature mismatch and unverified email. Unknown transactions after restart fail closed, while established sessions remain valid.",
